            "title": "Inspect a Delivery Response",
            "id": 152325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A delivery tracker needs the response's numeric status. Complete the attribute access.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A delivery tracker needs the response's numeric status. Complete the attribute access.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"status = response.status_code\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>status_code</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check GET Success",
            "id": 152326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the condition that recognizes a successful <code>GET</code> response.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accept only the standard success status for a <code>GET</code> response.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Success&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>==</code>, followed by <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Recall Not Found",
            "id": 152327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which status code means the requested resource wasn't found?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You request a reservation that was deleted. The server works, but cannot find it. Which status code matches this response?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Report a Server Error",
            "id": 152328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the branch that recognizes an internal server error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the branch that recognizes an internal server error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ok\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>status_code</code>, followed by <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Separate Error Branches",
            "id": 152329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Type the status code used to check whether the resource is not available.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" response.status_code == \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Server error&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the New Booking",
            "id": 152330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A booking API created a reservation with status <code>201</code>. Complete the general success check.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_success\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'create_response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Your booking API returns <code>201</code>. Use its general success property, which is false for error responses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the General Check",
            "id": 152331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which condition accepts both <code>200</code> and <code>201</code> while rejecting <code>404</code> and <code>500</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which condition accepts both <code>200</code> and <code>201</code> while rejecting <code>404</code> and <code>500</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code &lt; 500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check Before JSON",
            "id": 152332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which line should run before <code>response.json()</code> so failed HTTP responses stop normal processing?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>response.raise_for_status()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You read <code>response.ok</code>, but your code still parses a failed response as JSON.</p><p>Which line before <code>response.json()</code> raises an HTTP error and stops normal processing?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.raise_for_status()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the HTTP Error",
            "id": 152333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Type the exception name that catches errors of type <code>HTTPError</code> raised by <code>raise_for_status()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Request failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    except requests.exceptions.HTTPError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>HTTPError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
