            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which pair reads the exact code first and checks general success second?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.ok, response.json()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.json(), response.status_code</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code, response.json()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.status_code, response.ok</code>.</p></body></html>"
